        "header": {
         "text": "Response from Management on Aug 9, 2026"
        },
        "response": "Thank you for your generous post and we are glad that you enjoyed your stay at Hilton Tokyo.\n\nWe\u2019re delighted you enjoyed the room size, the view from the 32nd floor, and that the gym, pool, and location near the metro met your expectations.\n\nIt\u2019s great to know the two rooms were next to each other; we always strive to accommodate adjacent rooms when possible.\n\nIf you plan another visit and would like two rooms side by side, please mention this when booking so we can arrange the best possible setup.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back for another memorable stay."
       }
